-- ================= AoE4RPG Blueprints ===============
-- AoE4RPG Blueprints Blueprint Registry maps civilizations, classes, tiers, and unit blueprints.
-- Author: Hikitomi
-- Referenced: AoE4RPG_classes.scar, AoE4RPG_core.scar, and AoE4RPG_entity_tracker.scar.
-- ================= AoE4RPG Blueprints ===============

if not AoE4RPG then
    AoE4RPG = {}
end

